Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.14,0:00:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gyro Zeppeli wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.04,0:00:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We have our first race\Nleader on the Steel Ball Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.42,0:00:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.78,0:00:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Gyro came in first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.14,0:00:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The secret to his victory was...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.54,0:00:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,the power of the spin!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.92,0:00:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine work today, Valkyrie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.90,0:00:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to win this race, no matter\Nthe cost, so give it your all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.72,0:00:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No pressure, though, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.98,0:00:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Gyro Zeppeli.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.86,0:00:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That man does not volunteer\Ndetails of his past.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.62,0:00:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,According to authorities, he's new here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.22,0:00:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He came to America from Genoa,\NItaly this last May, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.54,0:01:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Steele.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.37,0:01:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So he's a foreigner?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.58,0:01:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.52,0:01:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He arrived on a ship registered to\Na certain Royal European bloodline.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.44,0:01:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Steele!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.92,0:01:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The deliberation results are in!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.58,0:01:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.72,0:01:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.10,0:01:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me my 1 in 5 billion\Nluck is coming gone already, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.78,0:01:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How could First Place have\Neluded me? Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.58,0:01:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I am D .O. Brando!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.56,0:01:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Would anyone like some food?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.28,0:01:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Our racers eat for free!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.56,0:01:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks like the registration clerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.34,0:01:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it a different guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.02,0:01:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.48,0:01:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Just the way you called it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.34,0:01:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my congratulations for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.70,0:01:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for that, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.64,0:01:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't be too gracious in defeat,\Nunless you're throwing in the towel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.62,0:02:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,To one and all, I laud your patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.68,0:02:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The first stage rankings\Nwill now be unveiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.42,0:02:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,After much careful deliberation,\Nthe winner of the first leg?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.96,0:02:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,is the possessor of Saddlecloth 990!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.80,0:02:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Sandman!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.08,0:02:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.48,0:02:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.88,0:02:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.00,0:03:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,much
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.91,0:03:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,for
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.54,0:03:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.14,0:03:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.30,0:03:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I will explain all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.66,0:03:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Based on observations\Nfrom our hot air balloon,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.68,0:03:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Gyro Zeppeli used a weapon\Nto obstruct the path ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.66,0:04:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It was at the end of the downhill\Nslope just before the final turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.42,0:04:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The end of the slope?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.76,0:04:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.60,0:04:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,As a result,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.82,0:04:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Gyro will be demoted 20 places\Nin this first leg of the race,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.36,0:04:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and the racers behind him\Nwill move up accordingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.58,0:04:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Dio's second, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.72,0:04:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And Poco Loco got third.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.08,0:04:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but the big news here is\Nthat Mountain Tim came in fourth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.44,0:04:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He squeezed his horse's nose\Nin there right at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.76,0:04:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Slow Dancer, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.54,0:04:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mountain Tim?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.22,0:04:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A cowboy forged in the\Ncrucible of the West.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.94,0:04:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd heard the rumors, of course?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.76,0:04:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That all horses bow their\Nheads in respect to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.56,0:04:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,when he passes by.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.90,0:04:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.82,0:04:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Steel, on a successful first stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.24,0:05:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Much obliged.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.54,0:05:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,When will the next one commence?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.32,0:05:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Something you wish to get\Noff your chest, Zeppelin?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.40,0:05:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Normally you'd be disqualified for\Nthat stunt you pulled back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.46,0:05:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, sir, no complaints.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.40,0:05:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No point complaining about the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.86,0:05:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like I can\Ntake it back now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.64,0:05:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.72,0:05:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I came here, so I can head\Ninto tomorrow on a fresh slate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.56,0:05:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy your champagne.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.22,0:05:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.12,0:05:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.44,0:05:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.96,0:05:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.87,0:05:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.68,0:05:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.62,0:06:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I paid cop's dollar to\Nship this into France!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.98,0:06:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.70,0:06:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.61,0:06:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Problem, Sheriff?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.08,0:06:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,May I have a moment of your time?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.90,0:06:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We should speak in private.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.74,0:06:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it wrong that made me feel better?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.94,0:06:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to nip at my heels in the\Nsecond stage of the race, Johnny Joe Star?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.50,0:06:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.56,0:06:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Right up until I breeze past you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.78,0:06:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.02,0:06:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is your second lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.02,0:06:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Never let your muscles\Nin on the plan. Ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.10,0:06:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Observe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.01,0:06:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The more pressure you apply when\Ngrabbing your wrist with your free hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.20,0:06:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,the more your muscles want to react\Nto that force by shaking it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.36,0:06:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The body instinctively\Ntries to protect itself
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.84,0:06:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,because the muscles sense what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.30,0:06:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it is with living bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.88,0:07:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The steel ball's spin keeps them\Nin the dark, so keep it skin deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.12,0:07:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, the muscles have no\Nidea something strange is afoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.02,0:07:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it skin-deep, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.96,0:07:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.02,0:07:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it a whirl, if you're up for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.48,0:07:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That champagne cork in your hand has\Nsome pretty good spin going already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.66,0:07:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's how you get off the horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.06,0:07:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Their muscles didn't even notice it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.56,0:07:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the reverse of the spin\Nfor when I got on the horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.96,0:07:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep the muscles in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.70,0:07:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not the steel ball itself,\Nbut the power of spin that's key.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.96,0:07:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Stage two of the race crosses\Nthe desert, Johnny Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.18,0:07:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Over 700 miles in total.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.44,0:07:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going to be tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.62,0:07:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I say we form an alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.68,0:07:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What better way to finish the\Nstage than in first and second?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.36,0:08:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the one in first place, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.98,0:08:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.89,0:08:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell am I looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.18,0:08:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty obvious, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.66,0:08:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're looking at the scene\Nof a brutal murder, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.64,0:08:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A massacre carried out\Nduring your steel ball run.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.04,0:08:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Over 3,000 racers took\Npart in that first leg of
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.72,0:08:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,the race and not a damn\None of them saw anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.66,0:08:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You think it was a jockey?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.64,0:08:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But what motive would they have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.16,0:08:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can think of a cool 50 million of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.46,0:08:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,For that much money,\Nnothing's off the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.36,0:08:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,All participants are\Nsuspects at this juncture,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.16,0:08:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and we must assume there\Nwill be more victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.82,0:08:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you intend to halt the race to\Nallow for a full investigation?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.64,0:08:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.55,0:08:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The steel ball run is bigger\Nthan any one man's ambitions now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.90,0:08:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.96,0:08:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.16,0:08:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.78,0:09:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The scent of these blooms\Nis said to calm the soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.92,0:09:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I would be honored if\Nyou would accept them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.02,0:09:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.66,0:09:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,worried sick
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.57,0:09:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,for your beloved husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.49,0:09:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, what life wouldn't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.52,0:09:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll sort this out finer than frog hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.04,0:09:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.48,0:09:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Tim is it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.58,0:09:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.06,0:09:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought him out to\Ntrack down the killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.66,0:09:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's right in his wheelhouses.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.38,0:09:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.80,0:09:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Track down the killer?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.02,0:09:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's a member of the race.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.98,0:09:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All the more reason to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.34,0:09:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, what better motivation\Nto catch the culprit quick?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.36,0:09:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm touched by your concern. Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.72,0:09:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Steel, I'm appointing Mountain Tim\Nas deputy sheriff in this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.04,0:09:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If and that meets with\Nyour approval, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.34,0:09:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A hell of a way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.38,0:09:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to win the race in peace,\Nknowing it contained so vile a villain?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.48,0:10:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a lot of friends in the race and\NI'll be damned if they get butchered.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.50,0:10:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If I have to pick a set of prints\Nto start tracking, it's this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.28,0:10:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta run a horse hard\Nto get prints like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.82,0:10:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's a mountain-shaped ship\Nin the middle of this horseshoe?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.06,0:10:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.68,0:10:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet you this horse was riled up,\Nprobably from seeing all that carnage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.76,0:10:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But the rider kept him under\Ncontrol during the murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.86,0:10:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They know the terrain a\Nbottle near the victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.18,0:10:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Something solid inside there\Nis that a close button.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.06,0:10:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it have something to\Ndo with how they met their
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.36,0:10:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,grizzly end it came off of\None of the victims jeans?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.32,0:10:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would the button be off though, and\Nhow did it end up inside that bottle?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.52,0:10:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,In any case,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.90,0:10:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,by the time our killer\Ngot close enough that
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.30,0:11:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,these poor unfortunates\Ntook stock of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.48,0:11:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,it was too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.86,0:11:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Five minutes until the starting gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.44,0:11:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The second stage is Herculean,\Ncovering some 750 miles in total.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.58,0:11:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be the work of\Ntwo weeks, give or take.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.70,0:11:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The racers will brave the deserts of Arizona,\Nreaching the goal in Monument Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.88,0:11:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So long as they pass through\Nour mandated checkpoint,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.56,0:11:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,they are free to choose their\Nown routes along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.92,0:11:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Gyro,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.83,0:11:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,the paper says Sandman\Nis the favorite to win
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.70,0:11:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,this betting and he's\Nthe odds on favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.66,0:11:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think? Not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.66,0:11:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no accounting for taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.48,0:11:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Clearly they're missing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.16,0:11:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know I'm the sixth most popular?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.30,0:11:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It says here that you're ninth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.18,0:11:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Pearls before swine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.74,0:11:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They wouldn't know talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.90,0:11:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,if I spun it up their ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.82,0:11:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that I care, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.32,0:11:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,See Mountain Tim over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.26,0:12:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's popular with the fans\Nand favored to win too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.72,0:12:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy there, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.26,0:12:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got a weird hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.86,0:12:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look, I kind of want to trample it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.88,0:12:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Bearing it if I'm being completely on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.98,0:12:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Mountain Tim is a bonafide cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.20,0:12:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Short stages aren't\Nsupposed to be his strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.24,0:12:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,but he still caught up with\Nme without my noticing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.02,0:12:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and passed me right at the finish line.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.22,0:12:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with that hat of\Nhis, you didn't see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.46,0:12:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Kind of beggar's belief.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.84,0:12:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking over a map of the area, I think our\Nbiggest challenge will be finding water.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.38,0:12:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,All 26 members of a cavalry\Nunit died out there in 1875.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.54,0:12:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't a battle or an\Naccident that did them in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.16,0:12:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A watering hole there for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.68,0:12:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They searched in vain for\Nanother source of hydration.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.86,0:12:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The burning sun beating\Nthe life out of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.98,0:12:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But it was no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.64,0:12:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,They all roasted to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.28,0:12:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.19,0:12:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The map says there's water here,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.60,0:12:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,30 miles out from where we start?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.46,0:12:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and the only one that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.84,0:13:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can't find it along the way, we'll\Nbe too dead to worry about the race.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.02,0:13:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, this cork, what do I\Nhave to do to spin this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.84,0:13:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Our racers gather at the line,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.74,0:13:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,ready to face the next of\Ntheir levers with daring do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.58,0:13:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And they're up, the second stage of\Nthe Steel Ball Run has commenced!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.58,0:13:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.49,0:13:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be damned! Gyro Zeppeli searches\Nahead to claim an early lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.58,0:13:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he stubborn as a mule or just an idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.64,0:13:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,When I warned him earlier,\Nwas he even listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.76,0:13:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.88,0:13:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,of course I'm going to follow him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.02,0:13:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming with you, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.74,0:13:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.44,0:13:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth is that police thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.26,0:13:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only jumping ahead,\Nbut changing cars, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.20,0:13:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.74,0:13:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he mean to skip\Nthe watering holes and
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.52,0:13:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,cut straight through the\Nmiddle of the desert?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.28,0:13:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you insane, Gyro?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.02,0:14:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We have 750 miles of sand ahead of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.64,0:14:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have a death wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.30,0:14:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Better not forget, we're still\Nrivals in this race, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.42,0:14:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking the quickest route.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.24,0:14:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Tag along if you want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.24,0:14:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Not much of a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.90,0:14:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody will take this shortcut.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.62,0:14:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet you Sandman will be right at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.18,0:14:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.04,0:14:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Man alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.26,0:14:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Jairo's not the only one\Nyelling to a certain death!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.20,0:14:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got a handful!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.92,0:14:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think anyone in their\Nright mind would take this route!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.28,0:14:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like they're trying\Nto kill themselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.50,0:14:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We must bid our intrepid racers farewell\Nfor the moment, ladies and gents.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.44,0:14:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll forge ahead as the railway decrees\Nand await their arrival at the checkpoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.50,0:14:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with that guy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.88,0:15:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's hanging from his ears,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.42,0:15:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,but he's kicking up so much\Nsand I can't really see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.38,0:15:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,His saddlecloth number is registered\Nto a man named Robinson, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.32,0:15:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He's about 150 horse lengths away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.66,0:15:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Gyro, we started\Nracing six hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.18,0:15:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure we're heading\Nin the right direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.22,0:15:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We're 50 miles out from the watering hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.70,0:15:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't make a mistake, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.92,0:15:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I only ask because that mountain\Nahead is pretty specific,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.38,0:15:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,and I don't see it anywhere on the ma -
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.00,0:15:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.54,0:15:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing to worry your pretty\Nlittle head about, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.00,0:15:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, more or less.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.72,0:15:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.63,0:15:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you just mutter more\Nor less, you charlatan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.84,0:15:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you all head up about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.78,0:15:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Folks are following us, so\Nclearly we're going the right way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.20,0:15:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably. Probably?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.98,0:15:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If we miss the watering hole,\Nwe will literally perish!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.08,0:15:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you actually know\Nwhere we are, yes or no?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.84,0:15:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a simple question, Gyro!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.56,0:15:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know where we are, give or take.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.90,0:16:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Deserts are kind of vague, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.28,0:16:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,On the topic of knowing stuff,\Nwhat about you mastering spin?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.04,0:16:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you spin the cork\Nlike how I taught you yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.38,0:16:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How come you stopped?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.04,0:16:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Just now, something flew by us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.90,0:16:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Gyro, oh my god, your\Near, it's barely... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.86,0:16:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.00,0:16:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.91,0:16:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,My arms all cut up! Up ahead of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.02,0:16:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever's hitting us is\Nflying in from that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.26,0:16:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.26,0:16:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He started galloping!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.68,0:17:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He's trying to catch up to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.42,0:17:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.33,0:17:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he the one who ambushed us? Easy, Gyro.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.94,0:17:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The direction of the attacks is strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.74,0:17:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They came from up ahead of us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.92,0:17:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We should get behind the rocks for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.98,0:17:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No big movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.90,0:17:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your horse calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.16,0:17:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever's attacking hit\Nus with cactus needles.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.00,0:17:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you familiar with the desert?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.10,0:17:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Familiar enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.66,0:17:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Around here, there's a cactus\Nthat shoots out its needles.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.68,0:17:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called a jumping Chili.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.72,0:17:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,When anything gets too close,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.56,0:17:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,it reacts to the vibrations in\Nthe air and fires a barrage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.22,0:17:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.26,0:17:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Jumping chollas all around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.94,0:17:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This portion of the desert\Nlooks to be full of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.58,0:17:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, who's at\Nfault for this debacle?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.46,0:17:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the blame ours for stepping\Ninto a patch of angry cacti?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.98,0:17:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Or option two?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.66,0:17:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Did our new friend down there somehow\Nmount an attack on us with the local flora?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.78,0:17:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure. As I recall,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.86,0:17:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,you have to get pretty close to a jumping\Nchoya to make it shoot its needles.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.20,0:17:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And he was never in\Nfront of us. Maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.20,0:18:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But he has a good motive\Nto take us out that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.60,0:18:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If the ruling is death by cactus,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.10,0:18:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,he can kill us in plain sight\Nwithout earning a penalty for it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.06,0:18:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.46,0:18:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We still don't know if he's the attacker.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.36,0:18:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, we're sitting ducks\Nout here in the open!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.12,0:18:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to run for it, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.86,0:18:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.84,0:18:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,They're cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.75,0:18:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, he cut my reins with needles?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.38,0:18:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How is he doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.78,0:18:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Get on your horse, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.34,0:18:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy has got us in his crosshairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.32,0:18:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me, Gyro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.70,0:18:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got blood in my\Neyes, but I can still see!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.14,0:18:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I said go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.68,0:18:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we promised to reach the finish\Nline together, but a race is a race!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.94,0:18:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you don't need to wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.50,0:19:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be right behind you, Gyro. I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.50,0:19:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.64,0:19:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go on ahead. Good! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.52,0:19:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Except...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.43,0:19:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,lie ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.42,0:19:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean straightforward that bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.94,0:19:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Gyro!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.85,0:19:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Your steel balls are\Nconsidered weapons, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.54,0:19:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And we don't have any proof\Nhe's the one attacking us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.32,0:19:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Assault another racer without cause, and\Nthey'll kick you out of the steel ball run!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.28,0:19:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.28,0:19:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here while you\Nstill can, I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.06,0:19:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish the race with\Nor without me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.90,0:19:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In some villages out here, whenever\Na dispute would lead to a duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.06,0:19:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,they'd chain the loser to a\Ncactus and leave him for dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.58,0:19:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,which he is in no time at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.50,0:19:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Growing up in a place like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.30,0:19:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I learned certain techniques to\Nkeep myself safe in the event of a
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.62,0:20:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight. I filled an eye socket with\Ninsects and claimed the advantage
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.80,0:20:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,the air pressure created by their\Nbuzzing wings lets me fire jumping
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.18,0:20:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Chil needles at whatever I desire
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.22,0:20:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and now that I have revealed my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.34,0:20:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,technique to you you must die first\Nplace will belong to me and me alone
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.60,0:20:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,it sounds like you and I approach the\Nissue in the same way did you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.36,0:20:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Think I just dropped my balls on accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.84,0:20:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I would never, which means\NI dropped them on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.16,0:20:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That low hum, I didn't notice it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.80,0:20:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's not coming from my\Ninsects, then what's the source?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.50,0:20:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I may not have the aim of\Nyour little bug friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.02,0:20:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,but my spinning balls can\Nvibrate something fierce.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.82,0:20:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They travel through the ground\Nand have got you surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.14,0:20:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The crossfire's gonna be brutal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.26,0:20:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd better find cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.44,0:21:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't do the least little thing to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.08,0:21:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But the cacti sure did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.34,0:21:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That ate up more daylight than expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.22,0:21:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatcha say, Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.82,0:21:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall we get back to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.10,0:21:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.42,0:21:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.72,0:21:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't run away from\Nthe south to the south.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.96,0:21:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The goal is still long.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.78,0:21:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, ball, run.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.72,0:21:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, ball, run.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.02,0:21:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, ball, run.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.10,0:21:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The goal is still long.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.72,0:21:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go, from the town. From the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.50,0:21:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like you're hard\Nto become stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.86,0:22:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like you're not going to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.32,0:22:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on your feet from\Nthe south to the south.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.84,0:22:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care if you don't\Ncare if you don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.36,0:22:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're against the\Nenemy, you're going to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.42,0:22:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have to compare\Nit to the other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.06,0:22:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want anyone to find\Nthe path I'm going to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.06,0:22:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's the biggest goal? Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.00,0:22:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you looking for a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.54,0:22:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We will be able to do the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.60,0:22:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a few more money.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.04,0:22:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to die like today.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.96,0:22:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to die or die or die.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.74,0:22:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to drive from\Nthe south to the south.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.18,0:22:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to wreck the fast pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.48,0:22:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still going to get to the goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.34,0:22:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, ball, run.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.88,0:22:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, ball, run.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.34,0:22:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, ball, run.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.86,0:23:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there, it's a Fool named Robinson.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.30,0:23:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't match the print.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.10,0:23:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for a horseshoe with a divot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.34,0:23:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how I'm gonna find our killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.50,0:23:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But I know I'm close\Nto tracking them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.78,0:23:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out the horse with the chipped\Nshoe passed by this ferry way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.92,0:23:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Not 30 minutes ago, I reckon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.18,0:23:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.18,0:24:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.18,0:24:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
